    "details": "<p><strong>Hackoverflow 10.0 &ndash; Official Software Hackathon of Aarohan 2026, NIT Durgapur</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Organized by</strong>: Team Aavishkar in association with NIT Durgapur</li>\n<li><strong>Event Type</strong>: Software Hackathon</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why Participate in Hackoverflow 10.0?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A platform to push boundaries, challenge yourself, and bring ideas to life</li>\n<li>Suitable for both beginners and experienced developers</li>\n<li>An opportunity to learn, build, and innovate while solving real-world problems</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What to Expect?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Exciting problem statements focused on industry-relevant challenges</li>\n<li>Mentorship and guidance from experienced mentors and domain experts</li>\n<li>Networking and collaboration with tech enthusiasts from across the country</li>\n<li>Attractive rewards including prizes, certificates, and career opportunities</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Who Can Participate?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to students from all backgrounds and skill levels</li>\n<li>Ideal for coders, designers, and ideators looking to create impactful solutions</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Next Steps</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stay tuned themes, and prize announcements</li>\n<li>Follow the official channels for updates and more information</li>\n<li>Prepare to ideate, code, and make a mark in the world of technology</li>\n</ul>",
